nd covers that actually worked.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"author\",\"content\":\"Jhay Sanyay\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"great album cover design examples,what makes a good album cover,album cover design breakdown\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"name\":\"creator\",\"content\":\"Jhay Sanyay\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"content\":\"index, follow\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"name\":\"googlebot\",\"content\":\"index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"5 Great Album Cover Design Examples (And What Makes Them Work)\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"What separates a cover that stops the scroll from one that blends in? A breakdown of the specific design choices behind covers that actually worked.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"og:url\",\"content\":\"https://jhaysanyay.com/blog/album-covers-that-actually-work-examples\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https://jhaysanyay.com/images/cover-art/khaidnww.jpg\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"property\":\"og:image:alt\",\"content\":\"5 Album Covers That Actually Worked (And Why)\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"article\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"property\":\"article:published_time\",\"content\":\"2025-12-04T23:00:00.000Z\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"14\",{\"property\":\"article:author\",\"content\":\"Jhay Sanyay\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"16\",{\"name\":\"twitter:creator\",\"content\":\"@jhaysanyay\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"17\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"5 Great Album Cover Design Examples (And What Makes Them Work)\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"18\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"What separates a cover that stops the scroll from one that blends in? A breakdown of the specific design choices behind covers that actually worked.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"19\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://jhaysanyay.com/images/cover-art/khaidnww.jpg\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"20\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?favicon.2vob68tjqpejf.ico\",\"sizes\":\"256x256\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"21\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.svg?icon.1hqt-6fdfs6lm.svg\",\"sizes\":\"any\",\"type\":\"image/svg+xml\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2b\",\"22\",{}]]\n","/blog/$d$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[53501,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"default\"]\n3:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"\"]\n4:I[85437,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"Image\"]\n21:X\n26:X\n26:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"Ci70N7G2LBQG0cqRgP2oF\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--paper)] py-12 border-b-2 border-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap max-w-4xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--red)] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider hover:underline inline-block mb-6\",\"children\":\"← Back to All Guides\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs text-[var(--muted)] mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--paper)] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px]\",\"children\":\"Design Breakdown\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"December 5, 2025\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"6 min read\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"font-anton text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl uppercase leading-tight text-[var(--ink)] mt-2\",\"children\":\"5 Album Covers That Actually Worked (And Why)\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[var(--ink)]/20 font-mono text-xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[var(--muted)] uppercase\",\"children\":\"Written by:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"py-16 bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap max-w-3xl space-y-8 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--paper-2)]/90\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative aspect-[16/9] w-full border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)]/30 overflow-hidden mb-10 shadow-2xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/cover-art/khaidnww.jpg\",\"alt\":\"5 Album Covers That Actually Worked (And Why)\",\"fill\":true,\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 800px\",\"className\":\"object-cover\",\"priority\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\\\"That cover just works\\\" is a common reaction and a mostly useless piece of feedback if you're trying to commission your own. Here's an attempt to actually break down \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"italic text-[var(--yellow)]\",\"children\":\"why\"}],\" certain design approaches succeed — not by naming specific commercial releases, but by walking through the recurring principles behind covers that genuinely stop the scroll.\"]}],[\"$\",\"hr\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"1. A Single, Unmistakable Focal Point\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"The strongest covers commit to one clear subject instead of splitting attention across several competing elements. A single striking portrait, one symbolic object rendered with real intent, or one character in a clear pose reads instantly at thumbnail size — where most listeners will actually first encounter it.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Why it works:\"}],\" at 100x100 pixels on a phone screen, a cover with three competing focal points collapses into visual noise. One clear subject survives being shrunk.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"2. Color Doing Emotional Work, Not Just Decoration\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Covers that stick tend to use color as a deliberate signal of mood — a narrow, intentional palette rather than a wide, \\\"colorful for its own sake\\\" range. A cover built entirely around deep blues and a single warm accent communicates a specific feeling before a listener processes a single visual detail.\"]}],\"$L5\",\"$L6\",\"$L7\",\"$L8\",\"$L9\",\"$La\",\"$Lb\",\"$Lc\",\"$Ld\",\"$Le\",\"$Lf\",\"$L10\",\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\",\"$L14\",\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\",\"$L18\",\"$L19\",\"$L1a\"]}],\"$L1b\"]}]}],\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\"]}],[\"$L1e\"],\"$L1f\"]}],\"isPartial\":\"$@20\",\"staleTime\":\"$21\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$L22\",\"isPartial\":\"$@23\",\"staleTime\":\"$21\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$L24\",\"isPartial\":\"$@25\",\"staleTime\":\"$21\",\"varyParams\":\"$26\"},{\"rsc\":\"$L27\",\"isPartial\":\"$@28\",\"staleTime\":\"$21\",\"varyParams\":\"$26\"},{\"rsc\":\"$L29\",\"isPartial\":\"$@2a\",\"staleTime\":\"$21\",\"varyParams\":null}],\"isUpgradeableISRFallback\":false,\"a\":\"$@2b\",\"rootVaryParams\":null,\"needsRuntimeRequest\":\"$@2c\"}\n2d:I[87879,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"default\"]\n2e:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n2f:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n31:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n32:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n33:I[27201,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"IconMark\"]\n34:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"default\"]\n35:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"default\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2b2j6nos8u62l.css\",\"style\"]\n5:[\"$\",\"p\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Why it works:\"}],\" limited, intentional palettes create instant mood recognition and also tend to look more cohesive as thumbnails next to each other across a discography.\"]}]\n6:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"16\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"3. Typography Integrated Into the Composition\"}]\n7:[\"$\",\"p\",\"18\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Weak covers often treat text — artist name, title — as a label slapped on top after the art is finished. Strong covers build text placement into the composition from the sketch stage, so it reads as part of the image rather than an overlay.\"]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"p\",\"20\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Why it works:\"}],\" integrated typography respects the composition instead of fighting it, and tends to hold up better across different crop ratios (thumbnail, full-screen, merch).\"]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"22\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"4. Specificity Over Generic Mood\"}]\na:[\"$\",\"p\",\"24\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"The weakest covers often chase a vague vibe — \\\"dark and moody,\\\" \\\"epic,\\\" \\\"vibrant\\\" — without anything specific tying the image to the actual project. The strongest ones include at least one detail that's genuinely specific to that release: a symbol, a color story, a character trait that couldn't be swapped onto a different album without losing meaning.\"]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"p\",\"26\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Why it works:\"}],\" specificity is what makes a cover memorable rather than interchangeable with a hundred others chasing the same generic mood.\"]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"28\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"5. Consistency Across a Body of Work\"}]\nd:[\"$\",\"p\",\"30\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"For artists with more than one release, covers that build a recognizable visual identity across a discography — consistent color logic, a recurring motif, a consistent illustration style — tend to outperform one-off covers that don't relate to anything else the artist has released.\"]}]\ne:[\"$\",\"p\",\"32\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"Why it works:\"}],\" recognizability compounds. A listener who liked one cover in a consistent visual system is primed to recognize and click the next one.\"]}]\nf:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"34\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n10:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"36\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Turning These Principles Into a Brief\"}]\n11:[\"$\",\"p\",\"38\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"These aren't abstract design theory — they translate directly into what to ask for when commissioning:\"]}]\n12:[\"$\",\"li\",\"40\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Push for \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"one clear focal point\"}],\", not a busy scene trying to include everything\"]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"li\",\"41\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Give the artist a \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"specific, narrow color direction\"}],\", not just \\\"make it pop\\\"\"]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"li\",\"42\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Ask for \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"typography planned into the composition\"}],\" from the sketch stage, not added after\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"li\",\"43\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Include \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"one genuinely specific detail\"}],\" tied to your project, not just a generic mood reference\"]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"li\",\"44\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"If you're planning more releases, think about \",[\"$\",\"strong\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"visual consistency across future covers\"}],\", not just this one\"]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"p\",\"46\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Illustrators who build commissions around a real brief-to-delivery process — like \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/#order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] font-bold underline hover:text-[var(--red)] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"album, manga, and illustration work here\"}],\" — are set up to work through exactly these decisions with you at the sketch stage, rather than guessing and hoping the first draft lands.\"]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"48\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"50\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Final Thoughts\"}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"52\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"A cover that \\\"just works\\\" isn't luck — it's usually a small set of deliberate decisions: one focal point, intentional color, integrated typography, real specificity, and (ideally) consistency with what comes next. Knowing the principles is what turns a vague brief into a cover that actually holds up.\"]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 p-8 bg-[var(--paper)] text-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--ink)] shadow-[10px_10px_0_var(--red)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--red)] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\",\"children\":\"Ready to Commission?\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase mb-3\",\"children\":\"Get Your Custom Artwork Stamped\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-sans text-[var(--muted)] mb-6\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay Studio handles custom cover art, manga/comic illustrations, and logo design from brief submission to final delivery. Fill out your job ticket below for a 48-hour quote.\